      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Without expressing any opinion on the merits of the case, this application is finally disposed of with a direction to the court below to decide the aforesaid case in accordance with law, as expeditiously as possible, without granting any unnecessary or long adjournments to either of the parties, preferably within a period of one year from the date of production of a certified copy of this order, if there is no other legal impediment.\nSmt. Renu Yadav vs State Of U.P. And 4 Others on 17 July, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/172117109/\n1",
